    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG is delighted to present this three-bedroom, semi-detached family home to the market. Benefiting from a large sunroom, No. 35 Elmcastle Green offers an outstanding opportunity for discerning purchasers to acquire a spacious home in one of the most sought-after locations in Kilnamanagh.\n\nIdeally positioned in a quiet and mature residential setting, the property is surrounded by well-established amenities. Vacant and ready for immediate occupation, the property offers enormous potential for buyers wishing to modernise and create a home tailored to their own tastes and requirements, as it would benefit from upgrading throughout.\n\nThe accommodation is flooded with natural light and briefly comprises an entrance porch, welcoming hallway, living room, open-plan kitchen/dining area, and a spacious sunroom extension. Upstairs, there are three generously proportioned bedrooms, including two large double bedrooms, together with a family bathroom.\nThe large private rear garden enjoys a sunny aspect, making it an ideal setting for outdoor entertaining, family activities, gardening enthusiasts, or future extension potential, subject to the necessary planning permissions.\n\nKilnamanagh is a perfect location with its own national primary school, shops and services on your doorstep, amenities and a great close-knit community. There is ease of access to all main road networks with the M50, N7, N81, and Belgard Road in close proximity. It is also well served by public transport with The Luas and Dublin Bus stop conveniently located nearby making the city centre easily accessible. Viewing is highly recommended"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nSee 3d tour for layout + dimensions - \nhttps://my.matterport.com/show/?m=azVWXccfFYj\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Three-bedroom semi-detached family home</li><li> Spacious accommodation extending throughout</li><li> Large sunroom extension providing additional living space</li><li> Vacant and ready for immediate occupation</li><li> Requires upgrading, offering excellent refurbishment potential</li><li> Large private rear garden with sunny aspect</li><li> Potential for further extension (subject to planning permission)</li><li> Quiet and mature residential location in Kilnamanagh</li><li> Excellent transport links with nearby Luas, Dublin Bus, M50, N7, N81 and Belgard Road access</ul>"
      },
      {
